      "short": "Green: $\\frac{11}{20}$; blue: $\\frac{5}{20}$; black: $\\frac{4}{20}$.",
      "worked": "Relative frequency is the category frequency divided by the sample size, 20.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Green relative frequency}&=\\frac{11}{20}=0.55\\\\\\text{Blue relative frequency}&=\\frac{5}{20}=0.25\\\\\\text{Black relative frequency}&=\\frac{4}{20}=0.20\\end{align*}$$",
